## 2. Technology Overview

PSHMP Core provides an intelligent networking layer for distributed systems. The design is built around several principles:

- decentralized data delivery;
- dynamic multi-hop routing;
- continuous network condition assessment;
- proactive recovery before complete failure;
- diversity-aware route construction;
- distributed candidate discovery;
- adaptive recovery under severe degradation;
- operation over existing IP infrastructure.

The architecture allows the networking layer to react to changing conditions without requiring the underlying IP infrastructure to be redesigned. PSHMP Core is therefore positioned as a **reusable technological foundation** rather than a standalone end-user application.

